  <!-- Ordering metadata so RimSort's auto-sort keeps this mod at the bottom (it landed mid-list
       after an auto-sort, 2026-08-22, which made TradersHaveMoney_Fixes' static ctor run BEFORE
       Traders Have Money's and silently lose). loadAfter enumerates every mod our fixes target -
       Harmony patch application order doesn't usually matter, but static-ctor ORDER does, and
       loading after all targets guarantees ours run last. Extend this list whenever a new fix
       targets a new mod. Belt-and-braces: RimSort's right-click force-to-bottom rule. -->
  <loadAfter>
    <li>brrainz.harmony</li>
    <li>VanillaExpanded.VanillaSocialInteractionsExpanded</li>
    <li>OskarPotocki.VFE.Pirates</li>
    <li>OskarPotocki.VanillaFactionsExpanded.Core</li>
    <li>Owlchemist.SmartFarming</li>
    <li>Mehni.PickUpAndHaul</li>
    <li>Mlie.ReinforcedMechanoid2</li>
    <li>defaults.1trickPwnyta</li>
    <li>AlexisPopcorn.VAC.base</li>
    <li>niz.xenomorphtype</li>
    <li>Grimworld.Framework</li>
    <li>Grimworld.Core</li>
    <li>HappyPurging.AgeofDarkness</li>
    <li>VanillaExpanded.VanillaTradingExpanded</li>
    <li>automatic.traderships</li>
    <li>SmashPhil.VehicleFramework</li>
    <li>Dylan.CSL</li>
    <li>GodlyAnnihilator.TradersHaveMoney</li>
    <li>PeteTimesSix.ResearchReinvented</li>
    <li>Woolstrand.RealRuins</li>
    <li>VanillaExpanded.VanillaTraitsExpanded</li>
    <li>ferny.CaptureExpansion</li>
    <li>CETeam.CombatExtended</li>
    <li>pb3n.SimpleLeadership</li>
    <li>co.uk.epicguru.meleeanimation</li>
  </loadAfter>
  <description>Local Harmony patch mod that suppresses NREs / log spam and fixes small runtime bugs from workshop mods where an XML patch can't reach.

Reconstructed 2026-07-05 from the recovered project spec after the original (Windows) copy was lost. MUST load LAST, after every other mod (enforce placement in RimSort). Compiled on Linux against RimWorldLinux_Data/Managed via dotnet-sdk.</description>
</ModMetaData>
